SUMMARY:Tarot & Astrology for the Collective
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nTune into the collective energy with us\,
  through the lens of Tarot and Astrology. This event will be a reading for
  the month ahead\, to help you move through the month with clarity and int
 ention. We will send a recording to the email given at registration and wi
 ll have space at the end to answer any questions or open shares.\n\nTicket
  Price: $10 per person\n\n**About your Hosts:**\nMarian Noble is a local A
 sheville tarot reader\n[energeticexperiences.co/tarot](https://www.energet
 icexperiences.co/tarot)\n\nJenn Wilson is a local Asheville astrologer\n[s
 ensefulwellness.com](https://sensefulwellness.com)\n\nBoth offer Private r
 eadings both online and in person.\n\nTicket Price: $10 per person
