SUMMARY:Community Night at The Light Center Dome
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**The UR Light Center Dome will be open t
 he evening of Aug. 1st.**\n\n*Interested in a full Stars and Sound Healing
  immersion? Get your tickets to the 2:00-4:00PM [StarSounds Event.](https:
 //urlight.org/events/star-sounds-050926/) Join the potluck dinner\, explor
 e the hiking paths\, and stay for Night at the Dome!*\n\nMembers of the co
 mmunity are invited to join hosts\, Liam and Michelle\, along with special
  guest\, Evolutionary Astrologer & Sound Alchemist David Heiss\, to create
  a Heart Centered Unity Field.\n\nThis is a “free flow” event to netwo
 rk\, meet and connect with others of light-mind\, celebrate\, meditate/gro
 und/center\, music\, chakra light room sessions and candle lit walks in th
 e labyrinth.\n\n6:00pm: Potluck Outside at the Light Center / Meet and Gre
 et\n7:00pm-7:30pm: Community Welcoming/Opening/Open Forum (In Dome)\n7:30p
 m-9:00pm : Music\, Mingle and Celebrate/Light Room Sessions/Candle lit Lab
 yrinth walks\n\nThis is a Donation based event open to all\, love offering
 s and donations benefit the Light Center and United Research. Bring your e
 nergy\, light\, water\, journal/pen\, seating preferences\, a musical inst
 rument and any sacred implements.\n\n*\\*\\*All times subject to change an
 d flow freely as the night progresses\\*\\**\nVisit [UR Light Website](htt
 ps://urlight.org/events/night-at-the-dome-080126/) to learn more.
