SUMMARY:✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong Meditation✨
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n🎶✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong 
 Meditation✨🎶\n**Sunday August 2nd 2:00-3:30 PM at Quietude Sanctuary\
 , Black Mountain**\n\n**Register here:** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsou
 nds.love/event-details/cosmic-quietude-astrology-gong-meditation)\n\nJoin 
 astrologer and sound practitioner **David Heiss of Star Sounds** for a nou
 rishing Sunday afternoon designed to help you align with the rhythms of th
 e cosmos while settling deeply into stillness\, presence\, and restoration
 .\nEach gathering begins with a **20-minute Astrology Transmission**\, exp
 loring the current planetary transits and the deeper themes moving through
  the collective and our personal lives. Through an evolutionary and soul-c
 entered lens\, David offers practical and inspiring insights to help you c
 onsciously navigate the energies of the week ahead.\nFrom there\, particip
 ants will be guided into a **50-minute Gong Sound Journey**. Surrounded by
  the resonant tones of planetary gongs\, singing bowls\, and sacred sound 
 instruments\, you'll be invited into a meditative state where the thinking
  mind can soften\, the nervous system can unwind\, and a deeper connection
  to Self can emerge.\nWhether you are seeking relaxation\, spiritual insig
 ht\, emotional renewal\, or simply a quiet place to rest and reconnect\, t
 his weekly experience offers a sacred pause from the busyness of everyday 
 life.\n**🙏Donations Start at $33-Please give more if you can. If $33 is
  to much\, just email David at [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starso
 unds.love)for a special price🙏**\n\n👤 **About David Heiss**\nDavid H
 eiss is an **Evolutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guid
 ing himself and others into deeper self-awareness through vibration and co
 smic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has worked with the transformative power of
  **gongs and astrology**\, following a profound awakening that shifted his
  life toward a path of healing and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n*
  **Astrological intelligence** (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sou
 nd immersion** (direct vibrational experience)\n\nCreating a space where p
 articipants can **remember who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intentio
 n is simple and precise: to help you **experience yourself more fully**.\n
 \n**Register here:** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-detai
 ls/cosmic-quietude-astrology-gong-meditation)\n\n**🧘‍♂️Please bri
 ng your own "sound healing nest"** including blankets\, pillows\, bolsters
 \, or any other comforts that will support you in resting deeply during th
 e journey. **Yoga mats are provided by Quietude.**\nCome settle into still
 ness\, attune to the wisdom of the heavens\, and allow the medicine of sou
 nd to carry you home to yourself.\n*"As above\, so within."*
