SUMMARY:Energy Medicine Circle with Archangel Michael with Lisa Gontarski
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nHealing with Archangel Michael\n\nArchang
 el Michael has an affinity for\, and loves to work with us. His healing to
 uch is very gentle\, yet deep. He would like to work with us on issues big
  and small. Even those issues we think of as too mundane for healing are s
 till based in spirit!\n\nMichael can be in many places at once\, and can w
 ork with each of us one-on-one\, even as we sit in a workshop together. He
  supports us individually\; our physical bodies\, our emotions\, and our s
 pirit. He’s there to protect us when we ask. He also has an eye on the l
 arger plan on earth and is here to assist with the unfoldings. In this wor
 kshop we will set a sacred space to work with Michael directly.\n\nDuring 
 this session you’ll learn how to connect with Michael on your own\, afte
 r the class. We’ll run through the process that I’ve used for many yea
 rs to communicate and work with him.\n\nANGEL ESSENCE ENERGY HEALING - Lis
 a has been a practitioner of Angel Essence Energy healing for almost two d
 ecades. This gentle and supportive healing modality assists with practical
  issues\, deeper transitions\, and everything in between.\n\nDonations Wel
 come.'
